  m_text: Class K fires, also known as kitchen fires, specifically address fires
    involving cooking oils and fats in commercial kitchens. While a grease fire in
    a home kitchen might be treated as a Class B initially, the scale and nature
    of fires in commercial establishments warrant this dedicated classification.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
